  D16: { kind: "done", title: "The gateway accepts the game's own limited AI key (cta_). It is the organizer role without payment links, cancel, erase, clone, reopen, keys and team steps. The organizer key can ask the game to e-mail a fresh 24-hour AI key to the organizer (typed confirmation); the key is never shown to the AI", question: "Keep both key kinds, or accept only the limited key? This changes the earlier rule 'organizer = master key'." },
