  D28: { kind: "done", title: "The gateway keeps an activity log of the calls made through it, in its own memory (bounded, no keys, no inputs). It is lost when the gateway restarts. The organizer reads it with list_activity", question: "Is a memory log enough, or should a lasting store be added? A lasting store is a separate step that may cost money (ask first)." },
  D29: { kind: "game_change", title: "A support ticket raised by key", question: "The game has none. Add one, or point to the Trust page and the console?" },
